elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b><i>Oil and Gas Translation Expertise<\/i><\/b><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Despite recent advances in green energy, oil and gas sector still plays an extremely important role around the globe. It is not limited to the Middle East with its immense oil and gas resources but currently it is expanding in many other countries around the world, especially in South America and Africa. The Oil and Gas industry has a great impact on the economy of many countries. Oil fields are usually located far away from the end-user. That is why such business requires good communication between all the parties involved in the process. Translation in the oil and gas industry is considered to be one of the most challenging ones, and it requires special knowledge of the industry-specific terminology, special terms and abbreviations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-41b0035 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"41b0035\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2e57345\" data-id=\"2e57345\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c7d068 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0c7d068\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/istock_000008312193-pg96e1esv9awoa29hndy7u1gzgc6jyea8259wc1rl6.jpg\" title=\"iStock_000008312193\" alt=\"iStock_000008312193\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-9cab0fe\" data-id=\"9cab0fe\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74f9ef8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"74f9ef8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>ABC Language Solutions has extensive experience in oil and gas translations. We specialize in translating industry related documents which include but not limited to:<\/p><ul><li>Drilling Expeditions Reports<\/li><li>User Manuals<\/li><li>Performance Data<\/li><li>Technical Descriptions and Proposals<\/li><li>Technical Specifications<\/li><li>Seismic Studies<\/li><li>Drilling Contracts and Legal Agreements<\/li><li>Safety Data Sheets<\/li><li>Equipment Manuals<\/li><li>Tender documents, equipment catalogues, and many others<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-755f225 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"755f225\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3ccc590\" data-id=\"3ccc590\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b44e7bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b44e7bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Quality of oil and gas translations plays a key role in proper operation and maintenance of equipment, safety of personnel, oil and gas operations, equipment installation and usage. Our oil and gas translation services can meet the highest standards and expectations of our clients. Since oil and gas industry has very specific terminology, translators should be aware of the terminology and jargon. Our linguists are thoroughly selected based on their specific knowledge and experience in the industry. They all have professional credentials and are highly experienced in oil and gas translations.<\/p><p>Working with industry experts and professional translators, we provide a multitude of oil and gas related linguistic services such as proofreading, expert review, editing and back-translation, to ensure that you receive ready-to-use, high-quality translations. Because we use cutting-edge linguistic software, our translations are always accurate, consistent, and formatted to your specifications.\u00a0<\/p><p>Your success is only a few clicks away.\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/risk-free-offer\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\"><strong>Discover what quality translation really means with our risk-free trial offer!<\/strong><\/span>\u00a0<\/em><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b4c341b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b4c341b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-70e3f7c\" data-id=\"70e3f7c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d644c62 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d644c62\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b><i>HOW CAN WE HELP YOU?<\/i><\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5055bd3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5055bd3\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3fbaa3a\" data-id=\"3fbaa3a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f1a0033 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f1a0033\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Oil and Gas industry is extremely technical in nature, and in order to get high-quality translation of oil and gas related documents it is crucial to engage professional translators who are not only proficient in the target language but also perfectly understand industry-specific concepts and terminology. One of the important features of such translation is that it requires use of special terms, expressions and abbreviations. We have a vast network of experienced linguists and engineers with great expertise in oil and gas translations, who are ready to help you!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c383037 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c383037\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8b93ed4\" data-id=\"8b93ed4\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eff6414 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"eff6414\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"601\" height=\"799\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istoc